## Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[Initialize head = NULL]
    B --> C[/Display Menu and Enter Choice/]
    C --> D{Select Choice}

    D -->|1. Add Order| E[/Enter Order ID, Customer Name and Food Name/]
    E --> F[Create New Node]
    F --> G[Set newNode next = head]
    G --> H[Update head = newNode]
    H --> C

    D -->|2. Display Orders| I{Is head NULL?}
    I -->|Yes| J[/Display No Orders Available/]
    I -->|No| K[Set temp = head]
    K --> L[/Display Order Details/]
    L --> M[Move temp to temp next]
    M --> N{Is temp NULL?}
    N -->|No| L
    N -->|Yes| C
    J --> C

    D -->|3. Complete First Order| O{Is head NULL?}
    O -->|Yes| P[/Display No Orders to Complete/]
    O -->|No| Q[Set temp = head]
    Q --> R[Update head = head next]
    R --> S[Delete temp]
    S --> T[/Display Order Completed/]
    T --> C
    P --> C

    D -->|4. Exit| U[Free Allocated Memory]
    U --> V([STOP])

    D -->|Invalid Choice| W[/Display Invalid Choice/]
    W --> C
```
